      "content": "We don't need to hide the sample size; we need to *reframe* its significance. Instead of focusing on the absolute number, emphasize the *depth* of the data gathered from those twelve participants. Frame it as a highly focused, intensive case study that provides unprecedented granular insight into the specific mechanisms you're exploring. This positions the work not as a broad generalization, but as a foundational, high-resolution proof-of-concept.",
